  "description": "The CLASH RACE is aimed at all riders who prefer ROCKSHOX and SRAM components.\n• The Zeb Ultimate fork with 38mm stanchions offers performance-optimised stiffness, a Charger 2.1 hydraulic cartridge with simple and precise adjustments, as well as a DebonAir air spring combining sensitivity and support. The Super Deluxe Ultimate shock is at the top of the RS range. The positive air chamber of the air spring can be adjusted as can the high and low speed compression settings.\n• The TRP DH-R EVO brakes are progressive and constant.\n• Wheels are from DT SWISS with their EX511 rims and 350 hubs. They are reliable and solid.\n• The SRAM GX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain features a wide 10-52t gear ratio.",
